        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/crimson-desert-trial.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Crimson Desert is one of 2026's most successful releases. The game managed to sell <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/crimson-desert-sales-6-million\">over 6 million copies in just three months</a>, and ended up being so profitable that its publisher ended up giving each employee at development studio Pearl Abyss <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/crimson-desert-success-bonus-employee-package\">a $3,400 bonus</a>. Since launch, the dev has been <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/crimson-desert-major-content-update\">committed to improving the game</a> and correcting some of the more <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/crimson-desert-rolls-out-huge-patch-to-address-end-game-combat-heres-whats-new\">egregious issues</a> that were present at launch.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/crimson-desert-free-demo-xbox-playstation\">Read more</a></p>",
